# 🎤 OPIc Comparison Question - Day35

## Question

How has the way people communicate changed compared to the past?

---

## Speaking Mission

Speak for 60–90 seconds.

Include:

- How people communicated in the past
- How people communicate today
- The biggest change
- A specific example
- Your opinion about the change

---

## Challenge

Use today's expression:

> Compared to the past,...

Also try to use:

> These days,...

> The biggest change is...

> For example,...

> As a result,...

---

## Recommended Structure

Compared to the past,...

↓

People used to...

↓

These days,...

↓

The biggest change is...

↓

For example,...

↓

As a result,...

↓

I think...
